  "contractDeltaInterpretation": [
    "Six of seven tracked contract paths differ. codeplzreadme.md is identical across all three snapshots.",
    "AGENTS and role/handoff contracts on feature remain fork versions; they lack target contractBaseline, statement-level synchronization, explicit full-audit coverage, MVP 1–2 pilot cadence and merged-candidate verification additions.",
    "docs/architecture/business-knowledge-model.md changed independently on both sides: feature added projection domain guidance; target added ontology evolution and contract requirements. Preserve both meanings with corrected IDs, rather than replacing the whole file from one side.",
    "docs/knowledge/README.md also changed independently on both sides and needs the same preservation of each domain increment and the target audit corrections.",
    "Target schema 1.2.0 and tools/knowledge-model module impose the newer controlled fact types, fact references and structural validation. Feature schema 1.1.0 and its older backend test command cannot prove compliance with that target entry point.",
    "The target knowledge workflow runs for pull requests and pushes to edhr-dev/main/master, records tested commit and validates test execution. It does not by itself make direct push preventive or establish branch protection; settings were not inspected here."
